---
source: crates/nova-cli/src/setup.rs
expression: "shown(&facts(Distro::Fedora, vec![Gpu::Amd], false))"
---
add the Quickshell package repository:
    sudo dnf copr enable -y errornointernet/quickshell
install Quickshell for the UI, and packages for bluetooth, files, peripherals, recording, screenshot:
    sudo dnf install quickshell bluez udisks2 upower wf-recorder grim wl-clipboard xdg-utils
create /home/me/.config/nova/config.toml
create /home/me/.config/nova/features.toml
write /home/me/.config/systemd/user/nova.service
write /home/me/.config/systemd/user/app-.service.d/nova.conf
reload systemd's units:
    systemctl --user daemon-reload
start novad with the graphical session:
    systemctl --user enable nova.service
link /home/me/.local/bin/NovaUI to quickshell
write /home/me/.local/share/applications/nova-files.desktop
write /home/me/.local/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/nova-files.svg
make nova-files.desktop the default for inode/directory
write /home/me/.local/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/nova.portal
restart the desktop portal, if it runs, so it reads that:
    systemctl --user try-restart xdg-desktop-portal.service
